== Description ==

'''Nitrate Ore''' is a mineable ore in ''[[Human Host]]'', obtained by [[Mining|mining]] terrain deposits. It appears as an ingredient in 1 downstream recipes at the [[Biochemical Workbench]], including [[Nitrate Powder]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

